{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55361","headline":"简寂观 · 江爲","name":"简寂观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才入玄都解郁陶，羽人相伴遍游遨。\n溪横洞口红尘断，岳耸天心紫气高。\n金井泉秋光潋灧，石坛松古韵萧骚。\n吟余却叹浮生事，尽[□□□□□□]。\n（同前书卷四。\n影抄本仅抄至「尽」字，空框从罗振玉《殷礼在斯堂丛书》校排本《庐山记》补。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"江爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}